Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Enables Windows Error Reporting LocalDumps for OrikaServer.exe.
; When OrikaServer.exe crashes, Windows writes a full crash dump (.dmp) to
; the DumpFolder below - no debugger attach needed.
;
; !!! EDIT THE DumpFolder PATH BELOW BEFORE IMPORTING !!!
; The default points to the original author's working tree
; (D:\VSCodeProject\orikaserver_proto\crashdumps). If that path does not
; exist on your machine, the registry write will succeed silently but WER
; will fail to create dumps (WER creates the leaf folder but NOT missing
; parent directories). Change the path to something that exists on your
; machine, e.g. C:\OrikaCrashDumps, before double-clicking.
;
; To apply: double-click this file and accept the UAC / confirmation prompt.
; To remove later: see disable-crash-dumps.reg in this folder.
;
; DumpType 2 = full dump (heap + handles - needed for post-mortem analysis).

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\Windows Error Reporting\LocalDumps\OrikaServer.exe]
"DumpFolder"="D:\\VSCodeProject\\orikaserver_proto\\crashdumps"
"DumpCount"=dword:0000000a
"DumpType"=dword:00000002
